## Phase 1: Requirements Analysis

### 1.1 Tóm Tắt Yêu Cầu

Dựa trên phân tích UX/UI trước đó, cần cải thiện toàn diện user flow của Luuniensuki LMS với các vấn đề chính:

1. **Navigation Flow** - Thiếu links quan trọng, không nhất quán
2. **Onboarding** - Không có hướng dẫn cho user mới
3. **Authentication Flow** - Không có return URL, gián đoạn trải nghiệm
4. **Learning Flow** - Motif → Lesson → Quiz bị đứt gãy
5. **3D Viewer UX** - Hotspots không rõ ràng, thiếu progress indicator
6. **Mobile Experience** - Chưa tối ưu
7. **Language Consistency** - Mix English/Vietnamese

### 1.2 EARS Requirements

```
REQ-NAV-001: WHEN user views any page THE SYSTEM SHALL display navigation with links to Dashboard, Badges, Collection, Explore, and Leaderboard

REQ-NAV-002: WHEN user is logged in THE SYSTEM SHALL display user avatar/name in navigation with dropdown menu

REQ-ONBOARD-001: WHEN first-time user enters /explore page THE SYSTEM SHALL display onboarding modal explaining the platform

REQ-ONBOARD-002: WHEN user enters 3D viewer for first time THE SYSTEM SHALL display interactive tooltips explaining controls

REQ-AUTH-001: WHEN user clicks login from any page THE SYSTEM SHALL redirect back to that page after successful login

REQ-AUTH-002: WHEN guest user tries to save progress THE SYSTEM SHALL show inline login modal instead of redirecting

REQ-LEARN-001: WHEN user clicks hotspot in 3D viewer THE SYSTEM SHALL display lesson sidebar with full content

REQ-LEARN-002: WHEN user completes lesson in sidebar THE SYSTEM SHALL offer "Take Quiz" option without page navigation

REQ-VIEWER-001: WHEN user toggles "Show Hints" THE SYSTEM SHALL highlight all undiscovered hotspots with pulse animation

REQ-VIEWER-002: WHEN user is in 3D viewer THE SYSTEM SHALL display progress bar showing discovered/total motifs

REQ-MOBILE-001: WHEN user views 3D viewer on mobile THE SYSTEM SHALL provide touch-optimized controls

REQ-LANG-001: WHEN displaying UI text THE SYSTEM SHALL use Vietnamese consistently throughout
```

